  "description": "Jaden never expected to be caught up in the Olsen family's drama, but Philip, his old friend and secret crush, is terminally ill and wants to see his son, the boy Jaden once babysat, one last time. Jaden agrees to help, even though Harry refuses to face his father. Their reunion starts as a clash; Harry feels abandoned by Jaden all those years ago, but his feelings for him soon resurface. And Jaden begins questioning his own heart…\n\n(Source: Tapas)\n\n*Note: Includes four extra chapters.*",
